# ONE PIXEL, TURNED ON BY A NUMBER.
#
#   python3 -m parts run light-a-pixel.parts
#
# Change 0.8 to 0.3 and run it again. The dot goes out, and the
# bar gets shorter. That is the whole idea: a number decides.

screen 12 6
put hot 0.8

var hot
light 2 2 at=0.5
light 4 2 at=0.9
meter 0 4 10 most=1.0
draw top=false
